NekroAgent derivative edition
=============================

This distribution is a derivative work of NekroAgent.

  Upstream project : NekroAgent  <https://github.com/KroMiose/nekro-agent>
  Upstream authors : KroMiose and the NekroAgent contributors
  Based on version : 2.3.3 (UPSTREAM_BASE_VERSION in nekro_agent/tools/common_util.py)
