Statement of changes
--------------------
The upstream source has been modified. The principal modifications are listed in
README.md ("与上游的主要差异" / "Main differences from upstream") and CHANGELOG.md;
in short: multi-instance operation, a platform console with multi-tenant permissions,
identity / favourability / memory isolation by memory domain, an LLM usage ledger,
credential encryption and startup audits, installer and compose changes, container
images published under a different namespace, and the tests and CI workflows that cover
them. Files that were modified, added or removed relative to upstream 2.3.3 can be
identified by comparing this tree with the upstream release.

