Optional component: qbob. qbob (a bridge from the QQ official bot platform to OneBot v11) is
an independent project licensed under AGPL-3.0: <https://github.com/Loping151/qbob>. Its source
code is not included in this distribution, and the LICENSE above does not apply to it. It is
